@startuml
' Part 1 of the workflow: intake, validation and concurrent scoring. The
' workflow is drawn as two diagrams because a single five-lane version has to be
' scaled so far down to fit the page width that its text stops being readable.
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Times New Roman
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam activity {
  BorderColor #2F4F6F
  BackgroundColor #F7FAFF
  DiamondBorderColor #2F4F6F
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FBFBF4
}
|Payment Client|
start
:Submit transaction;
|API Gateway|
:Validate request;
if (Request well formed?) then (no)
  :Reject request;
  |Payment Client|
  :Receive rejection;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|API Gateway|
:Load account profiles;
|Analysis Layers|
fork
  :Rule scoring;
fork again
  :Graph scoring;
fork again
  :RAG scoring;
end fork
:Emit three layer scores;
stop
@enduml
